msgid "Set Sampler options {#set-sampler-options}"
msgstr "Mengatur opsi Sampler {#set-sampler-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can set options when initializing Sampler, after initializing Sampler, or you can update the options after Sampler has been initialized. For instructions to use these techniques, see the [Introduction to options](/guides/runtime-options-overview#options-precedence) topic.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa mengatur opsi saat menginisialisasi Sampler, setelah menginisialisasi Sampler, atau kamu bisa memperbarui opsi setelah Sampler diinisialisasi. Untuk instruksi menggunakan teknik-teknik ini, lihat topik [Introduction to options](/guides/runtime-options-overview#options-precedence).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can set the  `shots` value in the `run()` method, as is described in the following section.\n"
"<span id=\"run-method\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, kamu bisa mengatur nilai `shots` dalam metode `run()`, seperti yang dijelaskan pada bagian berikut.\n"
"<span id=\"run-method\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run() method {#run-method}"
msgstr "Metode Run() {#run-method}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The only values you can pass to `run()` are those defined in the interface.  That is, `shots`. This overwrites any value set for `default_shots` for the current run.\n"
msgstr "Satu-satunya nilai yang bisa Anda masukkan ke `run()` adalah yang didefinisikan di antarmuka. Yaitu, `shots`. Ini menimpa nilai apa pun yang diatur untuk `default_shots` pada run saat ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Special cases {#special-cases}"
msgstr "Kasus khusus {#special-cases}"

