msgid "Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the selected feature:\n"
msgstr "Fitur-fitur Runtime tertentu tidak bisa digunakan bersama dalam satu job. Klik tab yang sesuai untuk daftar fitur yang tidak kompatibel dengan fitur yang dipilih:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamic circuits\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamic circuits\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks. Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Compatible with fractional gates when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 or later.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
msgstr ""
"  Catatan lain:\n"
"  - Gate twirling bisa diterapkan ke sirkuit dinamis, tapi hanya pada gate yang tidak berada di dalam blok kondisional. Measurement twirling hanya bisa diterapkan ke pengukuran terminal.\n"
"  - Kompatibel dengan gate fraksional saat menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 atau yang lebih baru.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Compatible with dynamic circuits when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 or later.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kompatibel dengan sirkuit dinamis saat menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 atau yang lebih baru.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Tidak kompatibel dengan:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling is incompatible with the [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Catatan lain:\n"
"  - Gate twirling bisa diterapkan ke sirkuit dinamis, tapi hanya pada gate yang tidak berada di dalam blok kondisional.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling hanya bisa diterapkan ke pengukuran terminal.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling tidak kompatibel dengan instruksi [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store).\n"
"  - Tidak bekerja dengan entangler non-Clifford.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

